# Dropped in the working directory by the Codex CLI. Contains an account id.
error.log

# Agent instructions and design notes. Local to this checkout: they describe how
# the work is done, not what the project ships. Anchored to the root so a fixture
# named AGENTS.md somewhere under src/ is still tracked.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md

# Audit findings quote source; they are a local artifact, not a repo one.
.cc-suite/

# Every working note: the plan, the measurements, the spikes, design handoffs and
# local audit artifacts. Untracked ON PURPOSE, for the same reason as AGENTS.md
# above — they describe how the work is done, not what the project ships. Losing a
# spike loses nothing, because every measurement carries its own method.
dev-docs/

# Assistant tooling, settings, and worktrees. The worktrees are checkouts of
# this same repo, so git reports them as untracked nested repos unless ignored.
.claude/

# VMark editor session state
.vmark/

release/
